*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "0.1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "HPM452NW.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "HP"
*Product: "(HP Color LaserJet M452nw)"
*ModelName: "HP Color LaserJet M452nw Open Print"
*ShortNickName: "HP M452nw Open"
*NickName: "HP Color LaserJet M452nw - Open Print PDF"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: True
*DefaultColorSpace: RGB
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "27"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*FreeVM: "64000000"
*cupsVersion: 1.1
*cupsManualCopies: False
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-pdf 0 -"
*% PDF is interpreted by the printer, using macOS's built-in PDF filter.
*% The loopback IPP driver implements these duplex choices in software.
*OpenUI *Duplex/Two-Sided Printing (Manual Reload): PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Duplex
*DefaultDuplex: None
*Duplex None/Off: "<</Duplex false>>setpagedevice"
*Duplex DuplexNoTumble/Long Edge - Reload Tray 1: "<</Duplex true /Tumble false>>setpagedevice"
*Duplex DuplexTumble/Short Edge - Reload Tray 1: "<</Duplex true /Tumble true>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Duplex
*OpenUI *PageSize/Paper Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595.276 841.890]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize
*OpenUI *PageRegion/Paper Region: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595.276 841.890]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion
*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea A4: "12 12 583.276 829.890"
*ImageableArea Letter: "12 12 600 780"
*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension A4: "595.276 841.890"
*PaperDimension Letter: "612 792"
*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: RGB
*ColorModel RGB/Color: "<</cupsColorSpace 1 /cupsColorOrder 0 /cupsBitsPerColor 8>>setpagedevice"
*ColorModel Gray/Black and White: "<</cupsColorSpace 0 /cupsColorOrder 0 /cupsBitsPerColor 8>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel
*DefaultResolution: 600dpi
*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(001.007)" Standard ROM
